.SS "void LibFS::iterate_entries (const void * buffer, size_t size, iterate_entry_callback_t cb)"

.PP
Iterate over directory entries and call a callback function to handle\&. 
.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
Will stop iterating if the callback returns false
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIbuffer\fP Pointer to entries 
.br
\fIsize\fP Size of buffer in bytes 
.br
\fIcb\fP Callback invoked for each entry 
.RE
.PP

.PP
